<title>JAPAN: Misawa Homes -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Misawa Homes -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		142.84		vs	  119.34</p>
<p> Operating	    6.44		vs	    5.48</p>
<p> Current		5.00		vs	    4.35</p>
<p> Net		    2.47		vs	    2.05</p>
<p> EPS		   19.22 yen	  vs	   16.05 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    129 million	  vs	 128 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  6.00 yen	  vs	    6.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Misawa Homes Co Ltd is a builder of wooden and prefabricated houses.</p>
